<title>USA: US adj retail sales off 0.2 pct July 12 wk - Redbook.</title>
<headline>US adj retail sales off 0.2 pct July 12 wk - Redbook.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. seasonally adjusted retail sales fell 0.2 percent, according to the Lynch, Jones &amp; Ryan Inc Redbook Retail Sales Index.</p>
<p>The index rose 8.0 percent compared to the same month a year ago, the report said. Adjusted retail sales advanced 8.0 percent in the week ended July 12, compared with the same week a year ago, it said.</p>
</text>
